+
+### Wallet balance history
+
+`noteCardHistory` also calls `noteWalletHistory` to persist actual
+`QuotaWindow.Balance` readings in `balance-history.json`, under a separate
+wallet namespace with hashed account/window/unit identity. Failed, estimated
+and stale readings do not add samples; `ReadAt` prevents cached reads from
+advancing time. `QuotaWindow.BalanceTrend` and `QuotaSpan.BalanceTrend` carry
+the series to the GUI and quota report. A first reading remains one point.
+Retention and downsampling match key balances.
